  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> Baron’s Secluded Library</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefits:</strong> Choose a magic, combat, or skill sphere you possess. When attempting to learn or create a technique or craft a magic item that uses the chosen sphere, add your level to any such skill check.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> You may select this feat multiple times, each time selecting a different sphere. This feat may be selected in place of an item creation feat.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/item-creation-feats#toc17\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
